{"ticker":"TFC","updated":"2026-11-20T23:22:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Truist Financial Corporation","shortName":"Truist Financial Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.truist.com","fullTimeEmployees":37833,"marketCap":54902759424,"trailingPE":11.806701,"forwardPE":9.367217,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0039263,"pegRatio":1.35,"targetMeanPrice":53.29737,"targetHighPrice":58.0,"targetLowPrice":45.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.158,"earningsGrowth":-0.462,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.35126,"profitMargins":0.2838,"totalRevenue":18276999168,"beta":0.871,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":56.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":43.13,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.46},"summary":"Truist Financial Corporation, a financial services company, provides banking and trust services in the Southeastern and Mid-Atlantic United States. The company operates through two segments, Consumer and Small Business Banking; and Wholesale Banking. Its deposit products include noninterest-bearing checking, interest-bearing checking, savings, and money market deposit accounts, as well as certificates of deposit and individual retirement accounts. The company also provides funding; asset management; credit card lending; home equity and mortgage lending; other direct retail lending; home mortgage lending; Investment brokerage services; mobile/online banking; payment solutions; point-of-sale lending; retail and small business deposit products; and small business lending. In addition, it offers asset-based lending, commercial deposit and treasury services; commercial lending; floor plan lending; derivatives; institutional trust services; insurance premium finance; international banking; investment banking and capital markets services; leasing; merchant services; mortgage warehouse lending; real estate lending; supply chain financing; and wealth management/private banking. The company was formerly known as BB&T Corporation and changed its name to Truist Financial Corporation in December 2019. Truist Financial Corporation was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Charlotte, North ","summary_zh":"Truist Financial Corporation 是一家金融服務公司，在美國東南部和大西洋中部提供銀行和信託服務。該公司透過兩個部門運作：消費者銀行業務部門和小型企業銀行業務部門；和批發銀行業務。其存款產品包括無利息支票、有息支票、儲蓄和貨幣市場存款帳戶，以及存款證和個人退休帳戶。公司也提供資金；資產管理；信用卡借貸；房屋淨值和抵押貸款；其他直接零售貸款；房屋抵押貸款；投資經紀服務；手機/網路銀行；支付解決方案；銷售點貸款；零售和小型企業存款產品；和小型企業貸款。此外，它還提供以資產為基礎的貸款、商業存款和資金服務；商業貸款；平面圖貸款；衍生性商品；機構信託服務；保費融資；國際銀行業務；投資銀行和資本市場服務；租賃；商戶服務；抵押倉庫借貸；房地產貸款；供應鏈融資；以及財富管理/私人銀行業務。該公司前身為 BB&T Corporation，於 2019 年 12 月更名為 Truist Financial Corporation。 Truist Financial Corporation 成立於 1872 年，總部位於北卡羅來納州夏洛特","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":45.6,"h":45.91,"l":45.16,"c":45.39,"v":6339500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":45.52,"h":46.21,"l":45.44,"c":45.7,"v":8004000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":45.81,"h":47.25,"l":45.48,"c":45.89,"v":8221100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":45.61,"h":46.02,"l":45.39,"c":45.74,"v":5384300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":45.99,"h":46.37,"l":45.64,"c":46.02,"v":4366400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":46.33,"h":46.33,"l":45.43,"c":45.92,"v":4902800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":45.74,"h":46.02,"l":44.79,"c":45.72,"v":9721700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":45.36,"h":45.84,"l":45.34,"c":45.57,"v":7257800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":45.55,"h":45.82,"l":45.19,"c":45.36,"v":5396500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":45.48,"h":46.05,"l":45.37,"c":45.52,"v":6539600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":45.56,"h":46.37,"l":45.01,"c":45.33,"v":9665800},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":45.65,"h":45.98,"l":45.14,"c":45.2,"v":6460300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":45.16,"h":45.27,"l":44.06,"c":44.14,"v":6915600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":44.42,"h":44.45,"l":43.79,"c":44.25,"v":6963400},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":44.38,"h":44.5,"l":42.3,"c":42.31,"v":8512300},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":43.0,"h":43.18,"l":42.58,"c":42.95,"v":7160200},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":42.64,"h":44.24,"l":42.6,"c":43.93,"v":10230700},{"t":"2025-1